// C15 — the message inventory (unreal/PLAN/CONTRACTS/messages.md), mirroring sim/Sim.Core/Events.cs.
// X-macro: DF_MSG(Name, "DF.Message.Name", FDFMsg_Payload). Append-only; a payload field change is
// an RFC. Every entry defines the native tag DFTags::Message_<Name>; the payload struct is in
// DFMessages.h. Several messages share a payload struct on purpose (same fields, same meaning).

